posts.text:
So, understanding we are to not have cares for this world, nor place earthly attachments over Christ, be it family, comfort, food, shelter, or even our own lives, to proclaim Jesus and confess Him before men, expecting tribulation and persecution, for the glory of God and His kingdom. And in return Jesus will confess us before the Father. And in our faith, sharing the good news to all who will receive it. And the promise made to us;

*He that receiveth you receiveth me, and he that receiveth me receiveth him that sent me.*

Amen
